{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c14e5fd811c5fceb27d236dbc784b24b86799eaaeee0127e858647f31d5d3826", "ja": "「あっ、{$P$}さんだ～♪」って、\n思わず手を振っちゃったんですよね～。", "zh": "一想到「啊，是{$P$}先生～♪」，\n就忍不住朝你挥手了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ca53edbc9d8c254194261efac6bf6dd8b1f2c18afd041dc57a85d2f0558005dc", "ja": "手を振っちゃったって……ダメじゃないか、翼。\nライブ中なんだ、ちゃんとステージに集中しないと。", "zh": "你说忍不住挥手……这样不可以喔，翼。\n在演唱会中，得专心表演才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "133bef00819490f3c67c759c982153c4b1fa7d4451ac89cdf96ca94ee2a3b035", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんなさーい！　つい……。", "zh": "嘿嘿～对不起啦～！我不小心的嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "28911140569befe2ffdb11c33ea17423e95f9aaff415e2c26076b78775f2eda5", "ja": "でもその後、ちゃんとお客さんにも手を振ったよ？\nわたし、えらいでしょ♪", "zh": "但我之后也有好好朝观众挥手喔！\n我是不是很棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "180dd8ca012f4c48344b30b7d0808cc7ed43e53d30a4ea326ffa940bb93dbb5c", "ja": "そうか。\n次はよそ見しないで、ステージに集中しような！", "zh": "这样啊。\n下次别东张西望，要专注在表演上喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0034_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6ef0d9e7b3869ec8ab56a634f28076655a23eae7cf7ff92fcf4c0c1b6646babe", "ja": "はーい♪\n約束するから、次のライブも、見ててくださいね～。", "zh": "好～♪\n那就这么约定了，所以下次演唱会，也请你好好看着喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
